  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Medio ambiente|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">(14 fotos) Seg&uacute;n el sistema autom&aacute;tico de informaci&oacute;n hidrol&oacute;gica (SAIH) de la Confederaci&oacute;n Hidrogr&aacute;fica del J&uacute;car, en Onda se han acumulado por el &uacute;ltimo episodio de lluvias 105 litros/m<sup>2</sup>. En Ribesalbes son 88 y en Alcudia de Veo hasta las 19 horas del domingo eran 59.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1193.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">Ha estado lloviendo toda la noche, en algunos momentos con m&aacute;s intensidad, pero sin causar problemas graves.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">El cauce del r&iacute;o Sonella baja lleno.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1201.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">Por precauci&oacute;n, la Polic&iacute;a Local ha cerrado &nbsp;la noche del domingo todos los pasos sobre el r&iacute;o o barrancos. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/11/IMG_1182.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">A las 9 de la ma&ntilde;ana de este lunes ya se han abierto algunos.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1182.jpg\" alt=\"img_1182\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1186.jpg\" alt=\"img_1186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1187.jpg\" alt=\"img_1187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1190.jpg\" alt=\"img_1190\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1191.jpg\" alt=\"img_1191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1192.jpg\" alt=\"img_1192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1193.jpg\" alt=\"img_1193\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1198.jpg\" alt=\"img_1198\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1199.jpg\" alt=\"img_1199\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1201.jpg\" alt=\"img_1201\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1203.jpg\" alt=\"img_1203\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1205.jpg\" alt=\"img_1205\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1206.jpg\" alt=\"img_1206\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/plugesriusonella27281116/img_1207.jpg\" alt=\"img_1207\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
